The renderer preserves dependency order. Workflows must not collapse layers into
one state or apply them concurrently where outputs create dependencies.

## Phase gates

- Discovery is always read-only.
- Rendering is deterministic and safe to repeat.
- External mutation begins only in bootstrap.
- Validation and plan do not authorize apply.
- Apply requires protected-environment approval.
- Destructive plans require explicit exceptional authorization.
- Verification is part of completion, not a post-project option.

## Handoff package

Every phase handoff identifies inputs, outputs, owner, timestamp, decisions,
exceptions, unresolved risks, and the exact next authorized action.

